  "meta": {
    "title": "6 Months Free on Doctor24 When You Hire D4U Immigration",
    "description": "Hire D4U Immigration and get 6 months of free access to the Doctor24 telehealth platform for you and your family in the United States.",
    "ogTitle": "6 Months Free on Doctor24 When You Hire D4U Immigration"
  },
  "body": "<header class=\"site-header\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <a href=\"https://d4uimmigration.com\" class=\"site-header__logo\" aria-label=\"D4U Immigration\">\n      <img src=\"https://d4uimmigration.com/wp-content/themes/d4u/assets/images/2025/Logo_D4U_cb2.svg\" alt=\"D4U Immigration\" width=\"49\" height=\"32\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"#formulario\" data-form-open class=\"btn btn-primary btn--sm\">Claim This Benefit</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main>\n\n<section class=\"hero\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"hero__content\">\n      <h1>Healthcare in the U.S. just became much more affordable.</h1>\n      <p class=\"lede\">Hire D4U and get 6 months of free access to the Doctor24 platform.</p>\n      <p class=\"lede\">A smart solution to help reduce one of the biggest concerns for people starting a new life in the United States.</p>\n      <p class=\"lede\" style=\"color:var(--gold); font-weight:700\">Save approximately US$150 for a family of four*</p>\n      <div class=\"hero__actions\">\n        <a href=\"#formulario\" data-form-open class=\"btn btn-primary\">Claim This Benefit</a>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"foot-note\" style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65)\">*Estimated savings based on the platform subscription cost for a family of four. Medical consultations are billed separately by participating physicians.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero__phone\">\n      <picture>\n        <source srcset=\"/assets/lp/doctor24/hero-phone-600.webp 600w, /assets/lp/doctor24/hero-phone-640.webp 640w, /assets/lp/doctor24/hero-phone-800.webp 800w, /assets/lp/doctor24/hero-phone.webp 1071w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 800px) 470px, 365px\" type=\"image/webp\">\n        <img fetchpriority=\"high\" src=\"/assets/lp/doctor24/hero-phone.png\" alt=\"Doctor24 app screen showing the user's health profile\">\n      </picture>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section section--white\" id=\"desafio\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"reveal section-grid\">\n      <div class=\"section-grid__text\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">The challenge</span>\n        <p class=\"lede\">One of the biggest concerns for people immigrating to the U.S. is the cost of healthcare.</p>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:0.9rem\">A single medical appointment can cost hundreds of dollars, especially for those who are just beginning to settle into life in the country.</p>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:0.9rem\">That's why D4U has partnered exclusively with Doctor24, offering a benefit that provides greater convenience, guidance, and access to digital healthcare for you and your family during your first months in the United States.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"section-grid__media\">\n        <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/assets/lp/doctor24/desafio.webp\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"section-photo\" src=\"/assets/lp/doctor24/desafio.jpg\" alt=\"Woman worried while waiting for care in a hospital waiting room\">\n        </picture>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section section--light\" id=\"beneficio\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"reveal section-grid section-grid--reverse\">\n      <div class=\"section-grid__text\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">The benefit</span>\n        <h2>Get 6 months of free access to Doctor24</h2>\n        <p class=\"lede\" style=\"margin:0.9rem 0 1.5rem\">When you hire D4U, you'll receive a free 6-month subscription to the Doctor24 platform. With Doctor24, you'll have access to:</p>\n        <ul class=\"check-list single-col\" style=\"max-width:62ch\">\n          <li><svg class=\"icon-check\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"9\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M6 10.5l2.5 2.5L14 7.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg> Free AI-powered health screening available 24/7</li>\n          <li><svg class=\"icon-check\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"9\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M6 10.5l2.5 2.5L14 7.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg> Smart consultations to help guide your care</li>\n          <li><svg class=\"icon-check\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"9\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M6 10.5l2.5 2.5L14 7.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg> Telehealth appointments with licensed physicians</li>\n          <li><svg class=\"icon-check\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"9\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M6 10.5l2.5 2.5L14 7.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg> Digital prescriptions, lab orders, and medical certificates</li>\n          <li><svg class=\"icon-check\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"9\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M6 10.5l2.5 2.5L14 7.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg> Follow-up with your doctor for up to 7 days after your consultation</li>\n          <li><svg class=\"icon-check\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"9\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M6 10.5l2.5 2.5L14 7.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg> A complete and organized digital health record</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p class=\"lede\" style=\"margin-top:1.4rem\">All of this, right from your smartphone — wherever you are.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"section-grid__media\">\n        <div class=\"carousel-fade\">\n          <div class=\"carousel-fade__slide is-active\">\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/assets/lp/doctor24/beneficio-1.webp\" type=\"image/webp\">\n              <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"336\" height=\"299\" src=\"/assets/lp/doctor24/beneficio-1.png\" alt=\"Doctor24 screen showing health history and an access QR code\">\n            </picture>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"carousel-fade__slide\">\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/assets/lp/doctor24/beneficio-2.webp\" type=\"image/webp\">\n              <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"336\" height=\"281\" src=\"/assets/lp/doctor24/beneficio-2.png\" alt=\"Doctor24 user profile screen with progress and lifestyle\">\n            </picture>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"carousel-fade__slide\">\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/assets/lp/doctor24/beneficio-3.webp\" type=\"image/webp\">\n              <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"336\" height=\"299\" src=\"/assets/lp/doctor24/beneficio-3.png\" alt=\"Doctor24 complete medical analysis screen with executive summary\">\n            </picture>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section section--white\" id=\"economia\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"reveal section-grid\">\n      <div class=\"section-grid__text\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Savings</span>\n        <h2 style=\"margin-bottom:1.4rem\">More savings for your family</h2>\n        <div class=\"callout\">\n          <p>Save approximately US$150 on your platform subscription.</p>\n          <p>When you hire D4U, you receive 6 months of free access for the primary applicant and eligible dependents included in the immigration process. Enjoy greater peace of mind while taking care of your family's health as you adapt to your new life in the United States.</p>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"foot-note\">*Estimated savings for a family of four.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"section-grid__media\">\n        <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/assets/lp/doctor24/economia.webp\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"section-photo\" src=\"/assets/lp/doctor24/economia.jpg\" alt=\"Couple holding an American flag in front of a house\">\n        </picture>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section section--light\" id=\"como-funciona\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"reveal\" style=\"max-width:960px; margin:0 auto; text-align:center\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">How it works</span>\n      <h2>How does it work?</h2>\n      <ol class=\"timeline\" style=\"margin-top:1.6rem; text-align:left\">\n        <li><span class=\"timeline__num\">1</span><span class=\"timeline__text\">Hire one of D4U's international planning services.</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"timeline__num\">2</span><span class=\"timeline__text\">Receive 6 months of free access to the Doctor24 platform.</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"timeline__num\">3</span><span class=\"timeline__text\">Register yourself and your eligible dependents.</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"timeline__num\">4</span><span class=\"timeline__text\">Whenever you need medical guidance, use the platform for AI-powered health screening, consultations, and follow-up care.</span></li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section section--white\" id=\"diferenca\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"reveal section-grid\">\n      <div class=\"section-grid__text\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Why it matters</span>\n        <h2>Why does this benefit make a difference?</h2>\n        <p class=\"lede\" style=\"margin-top:0.9rem\">Because moving to the United States comes with many expenses.</p>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:0.9rem\">Having access to a digital healthcare platform means greater convenience when you need medical guidance, while saving on your platform subscription and enjoying care wherever you are.</p>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:0.9rem\">We're committed to supporting your journey before, during, and after your move to the United States.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"section-grid__media\">\n        <div class=\"image-stack\">\n          <picture class=\"image-stack__back\">\n            <source srcset=\"/assets/lp/doctor24/diferenca-2.webp\" type=\"image/webp\">\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/lp/doctor24/diferenca-2.jpg\" alt=\"Woman smiling while looking at her phone\">\n          </picture>\n          <picture class=\"image-stack__front\">\n            <source srcset=\"/assets/lp/doctor24/diferenca-1.webp\" type=\"image/webp\">\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/lp/doctor24/diferenca-1.png\" alt=\"Video consultation with a doctor via smartphone\">\n          </picture>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"cta-band\" id=\"cta-final\">\n  <div class=\"container reveal\">\n    <h2>Your international journey now comes with even greater peace of mind for your family.</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\">Hire D4U and get 6 months of free access to Doctor24.</p>\n    <ul class=\"pill-list pill-list--on-dark pill-list--horizontal\">\n      <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 21s-7-4.35-9.5-9A5.5 5.5 0 0112 5.5 5.5 5.5 0 0121.5 12c-2.5 4.65-9.5 9-9.5 9z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg> More affordable healthcare</li>\n      <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13 2L4 14h6l-1 8 9-12h-6l1-8z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg> Greater convenience</li>\n      <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M12 7v10M9.5 9.3c0-1 .9-1.6 2.5-1.6s2.5.7 2.5 1.5c0 1.7-5 1.1-5 3 0 .9 1 1.6 2.5 1.6s2.5-.6 2.5-1.6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg> More savings for your family</li>\n    </ul>\n    <a href=\"#formulario\" data-form-open class=\"btn btn-primary\">Speak With a Specialist</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n</main>\n\n<footer class=\"site-footer\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <p>*Benefit valid for new D4U contracts for the primary applicant and eligible dependents included in the immigration process. The Doctor24 platform subscription is free for the first 6 months. Medical consultations are billed separately, and fees are determined by the participating physicians. Benefit subject to Doctor24's Terms of Use.</p>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n<div class=\"sticky-cta\" id=\"stickyCta\">\n  <a href=\"#formulario\" data-form-open class=\"btn btn-primary\">Claim This Benefit</a>\n</div>"
}
